    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow Cone is a Sokoban-like puzzle game about rolling icy treats and cleaning up the streets! Arrange snowballs into elegant Snow Cones to match customers' orders in dozens of challenging puzzles. Meet interesting characters and expose the truth behind the city's shady penguin underbelly. (It's not all black and white!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLL SNOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll snow to make different-sized snowballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/987f722ae7fc0dbc3b16cc04259d5e49.poster.avif?t=1752552855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/987f722ae7fc0dbc3b16cc04259d5e49.webm?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/987f722ae7fc0dbc3b16cc04259d5e49.mp4?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCOOP SNOWBALLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop up snowballs by pushing them into fences, crates, or other snowballs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/4aaabbd444bc6c95d52d1c1f2c3ee332.poster.avif?t=1752552855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/4aaabbd444bc6c95d52d1c1f2c3ee332.webm?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/4aaabbd444bc6c95d52d1c1f2c3ee332.mp4?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATCH THE ORDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack snowballs in the correct order to  complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/818a383dc99a2c6cebde706869c757be.poster.avif?t=1752552855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/818a383dc99a2c6cebde706869c757be.webm?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/818a383dc99a2c6cebde706869c757be.mp4?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pedro is new to town and is immediately caught up in a case of a missing Snow Cone vendor, fishy business dealings and local law enforcement who will stop at nothing to get to the bottom of it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/ba3a804d2bbdd428a2c99bd956f6fb98.avif?t=1752552855\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruited by Sarge, Pedro learns how to make delicious Snow Cones while going undercover. Some customers are up to no good and Pedro soon finds themselves in too deep and skating on thin ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/2bacb12d6c014829b3fd080e88072d57.avif?t=1752552855\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of handcrafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun characters and story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh take on Sokoban mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited undo and no time limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and retro pixel-art aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original jazz-inspired soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for all ages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow Cone is a Sokoban-like puzzle game about rolling icy treats and cleaning up the streets! Arrange snowballs into elegant Snow Cones to match customers' orders in dozens of challenging puzzles. Meet interesting characters and expose the truth behind the city's shady penguin underbelly. (It's not all black and white!)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLL SNOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll snow to make different-sized snowballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/987f722ae7fc0dbc3b16cc04259d5e49.poster.avif?t=1752552855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/987f722ae7fc0dbc3b16cc04259d5e49.webm?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/987f722ae7fc0dbc3b16cc04259d5e49.mp4?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SCOOP SNOWBALLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop up snowballs by pushing them into fences, crates, or other snowballs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/4aaabbd444bc6c95d52d1c1f2c3ee332.poster.avif?t=1752552855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/4aaabbd444bc6c95d52d1c1f2c3ee332.webm?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/4aaabbd444bc6c95d52d1c1f2c3ee332.mp4?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MATCH THE ORDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack snowballs in the correct order to  complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/818a383dc99a2c6cebde706869c757be.poster.avif?t=1752552855\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/818a383dc99a2c6cebde706869c757be.webm?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/818a383dc99a2c6cebde706869c757be.mp4?t=1752552855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pedro is new to town and is immediately caught up in a case of a missing Snow Cone vendor, fishy business dealings and local law enforcement who will stop at nothing to get to the bottom of it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/ba3a804d2bbdd428a2c99bd956f6fb98.avif?t=1752552855\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruited by Sarge, Pedro learns how to make delicious Snow Cones while going undercover. Some customers are up to no good and Pedro soon finds themselves in too deep and skating on thin ice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445270/extras/2bacb12d6c014829b3fd080e88072d57.avif?t=1752552855\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of handcrafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun characters and story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fresh take on Sokoban mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited undo and no time limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute and retro pixel-art aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original jazz-inspired soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for all ages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
